 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking the price",
     "texto": [
      "**Quanto costa?** for one thing and **Quanto costano?** for several: **Quanto costa questo vestito?**, **Quanto costano queste scarpe?**",
      "**Troppo** before an adjective means «too» and doesn't change: **troppo caro**, **troppo piccola**.",
      "**Caro** means «expensive»; the opposite is **economico**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "In the shop",
     "texto": [
      "**Posso provare?** = can I try it on?",
      "**La taglia** is the size of clothing; for shoes you say **il numero**.",
      "In **Lo prendo**, **lo** replaces **il vestito**; in **La prendo**, **la** replaces **la giacca**. The direct pronoun goes before the verb. In the plural: **li prendo**, **le prendo**.",
      "To pay: **con la carta** (by card) or **in contanti** (in cash)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
